{"agent_id":"pp3g-vRPR-prune-old-kickoff-swarm-subagent-sessions-from-the","agent_seq":4,"timestamp":"2026-08-08T17:52:41.716219218Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"cf966cd1-1b10-4dce-8db6-71b6b7d1669a","comment_uuid":"8e0c64f8-39ec-4fc1-93c9-67ff4483a3f1","author":"pp3g-vRPR-prune-old-kickoff-swarm-subagent-sessions-from-the","content":"Plan: prune old kickoff/swarm subagent sessions from opencode.db per operator-approved scope.\n\n**Target set** (verified live): sessions WHERE directory LIKE '%.worktrees/pp3g-%' AND date(time_created/1000,'unixepoch') < '2026-08-08' AND id != 'ses_0290e3d86ffe5doJ0fsFTdFBGE' (mandatory exclusion).\n- 145 sessions / 31,261 parts (67.07 MB) / 6,994 messages (6.3 MB) / 227 todos ≈ 73.4 MB raw payload.\n- Note: issue headline said 145 sessions / 32,455 parts — the parts delta (1,194) is the mandatory-excluded safeIterable session's own parts; actual deletion set is 31,261 parts. Sessions count matches (146 raw minus 1 exclusion = 145).\n- All 2026-08-08 sessions (incl. live Mpl9 #270 + WzWe #293 + my own) are excluded by the date predicate — verified present in the 2026-08-08 list.\n\n**Schema**: opencode.db is WAL mode, page_size 4096. session/message/part/session_message/session_input/todo/session_share/session_context_epoch all have ON DELETE CASCADE FKs on session_id. sqlite CLI has foreign_keys=OFF by default, so children will be deleted explicitly in FK-safe order (part → message → todo → session) inside one transaction, which also matches the issue's stated order.\n\n**Procedure**:\n1. BACKUP — done: /home/claude-code/.local/share/opencode/backups/opencode.db.pre-prune-20260808-175132/ (opencode.db 2.04GB + -wal + -shm); integrity_check on copy = ok.\n2. DRY-RUN — exact DELETEs inside BEGIN/ROLLBACK, capture page_count/freelist_count + changes() before/after, post numbers.\n3. EXECUTE — same DELETEs in one committed transaction (busy_timeout for live-writer contention).\n4. SHRINK — wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE) then VACUUM; if VACUUM hits 'database is locked' (live Mpl9/WzWe writers), checkpoint + report, defer VACUUM.\n5. VERIFY — integrity_check, session counts before/after, excluded sessions still present, trivial read.\n\nNo kickoff cleanup --force (#227). No touching crosslink target dir or other DBs.","created_at":"2026-08-08T17:52:41.702754223Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:dsXFTiLxvVRyYfMS0xlrfc+SX/y94lOqIk0PrG2nejw","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg5chBftXyyuv9RZhm/KrorZtSV6Qsy4+U00ZSP5divmQAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAU03efiMHHVcGV2nAfJS5214FKw2BHJpSG2JkGq6kJzbSJOHh1sV3SXw0dyG36vLlIVgewrHkT1J0m0HwgkMJCQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:dsXFTiLxvVRyYfMS0xlrfc+SX/y94lOqIk0PrG2nejw","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg5chBftXyyuv9RZhm/KrorZtSV6Qsy4+U00ZSP5divmQAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQB7At+nLj+9YFFclEe9eouoWyXGvfFbo2/UEaV8DpZxENFRpOTBlQ0rZ1ahdbCWU/tiBiKebBT1/YoXZ7tYI9gE="}
